    {
      "objectKey": "mathematicalhandboost",
      "id": "c6f5382b-307d-460d-bd76-09cf4c887bf5",
      "name": "Mathematical Hand Boost",
      "description": "Give Chips and Mult depending on the {C:attention}rarity{} of your hand, based[s] on the number of combinations in a 7-card Texas Hold em' Hand[s]{s:0.8,C:inactive}(Equation is on the card, High Card, Pair, & Secret Hands are execptions){}[s]The following Chips and Mult are:[s]High Card: {C:blue}+5{}, {C:red}+1{}; Pair: {C:blue}+10{}, {C:red}+2{}; Two Pair: {C:blue}+15{}, {C:red}+3{}; 3OAK: {C:blue}+30{}, {C:red}+6{};[s]Straight: {C:blue}+35{}, {C:red}+6{}; Flush: {C:blue}+35{}, {C:red}+7{}; F. House: {C:blue}+35{}, {C:red}+8{}; 40AK: {C:blue}+65{}, {C:red}+12{};[s] S. Flush: {C:blue}+80{}, {C:red}+16{}; 5OAK: {C:blue}+110{}, {C:red}+20{}, Fl. House: {C:blue}+115{}, {C:red}+24{}, Fl. 5: {C:blue}+150{}, {C:red}+28{}",
